{"id": 9053285744838, "title": "Momcozy Upgraded Breastmilk Storage Bags", "body_html": "<p><strong><span class=\"a-list-item\">Visual Temp-Sensing for Even Milk Temperature:</span><span class=\"a-list-item\"> </span></strong><span class=\"a-list-item\">Extra-long vertical strip reads temperature at every level, so no more hot bottom, cold top. Color change shows perfect feeding temp at a glance. These smart breastmilk storage bags make nighttime feedings totally stress-free — the milk storage bags every breastfeeding mom needs.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Double Zip Lock &amp; Leak-Proof Seal: </strong>Advanced double-zipper closure clicks tight with color-alignment guides to confirm a full seal every time. These breast milk bags protect every precious drop from leaks, whether upright or flat in the freezer. The only breastfeeding milk bags you'll trust for your freezer stash.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Stand-Up Base &amp; Easy-Write Label:</strong> Widened gusset bottom lets each bag stand securely for hands-free pouring. Spacious write-on area tracks date, time, and volume for easy organization. Perfect milk bags for breastmilk and essential pumping storage bags for busy moms building a freezer supply</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>BPA-Free &amp; Pre-Sterilized for Baby: </strong>Food-grade, BPA/BPS-free material prioritizes your little one's safe. Pre-sterilized and ready to use straight from the box. Thick, durable construction resists tears and freezer burn. These breastmilk freezer bags are trusted milk storage containers for safe, long-term storage.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Multi-Purpose Beyond Breastfeeding: </strong>Airtight, durable design works for baby food, snacks, juice, and travel portions long after nursing ends. Compact and portable, these versatile breast milk storage bags fit easily into any pump bag. A practical baby essential and thoughtful baby shower 